      {
        "id": 164311,
        "name": "riff.freelance",
        "username": "riff.freelance",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/riff.freelance/{size}/2050_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-03-03T02:36:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Oh, man where to begin?</p><p>Harpy and a \"full\" 5 man Nightwatch team. This just screams fun.</p><p>The Mission deck and what we hope it contains. The Gate heroes, Ennead members, nifty new gear?!?! Who knows what fun it holds!!!</p><p>11 new heroes. For me heroes are the meat and potatoes to any Sentinels product, this is where the fun is had. There will be so much to do with them even outside \"Oblivaeon mode.\" Versus evil self grudge matches, new team themes, Void Guard teamed with the Southwest Sentinels. This is just going to be so much fun! Add the promos with this point. New Omnitron X and Skyscraper. New Visionary and Ra. New Prime Wardens and Freedom Five. So much nifty.&nbsp;</p><p>Oddly I'm also excited that this is the end. It's bittersweet, but it also opens up new avenues. Greater Than Games can dedicate more energy to it's next big project and it's other Sentinels stuff. Fan made stuff will be able to be talked about somewhere (maybe even here.) Massive speculation and hopefully official answers to our outstanding questions.&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 22,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:45:29.992Z",
